// Windows resource script for farman.
//
// Embeds the application icon (images/icon.ico) into farman.exe so that:
//   - Windows Explorer shows the farman icon for the .exe file
//   - The taskbar uses it
//   - Inno Setup's "UninstallDisplayIcon" entry in Add/Remove Programs
//     picks it up (since UninstallDisplayIcon points to farman.exe)
//   - Pinned start menu / desktop shortcuts created by Inno Setup use it
//
// IDI_ICON1 = the first icon resource. Windows Explorer / shell display
// the lowest-numbered ICON resource for the executable.
//
// `@CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR@/images/icon.ico` is substituted by
// configure_file() at CMake time. RC compilers (rc.exe / windres) accept
// forward slashes for paths since their introduction.

IDI_ICON1 ICON "@CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR@/images/icon.ico"
